1
00:00:00,415 --> 00:00:03,545
- Okay, dig in.
- Hold up.

2
00:00:05,687 --> 00:00:09,387
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)Bless us, O Lord, for these thy gifts
which we are about to receive...

3
00:00:09,591 --> 00:00:12,421
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)...from thy bounty through Christ our Lord,
amen.

4
00:00:15,864 --> 00:00:17,694
(Howard:)Took the words right out of my mouth.

5
00:00:20,602 --> 00:00:22,832
(Bernadette:)So, Dad, have you done any fishing lately?

6
00:00:23,037 --> 00:00:26,197
- I'm going next weekend.
- Oh. You like to fish?

7
00:00:27,275 --> 00:00:28,905
(Sheldon:)Yes.

8
00:00:31,713 --> 00:00:34,613
(Howard:)Sure. I can hear it in your voice.

9
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:38,950
(Mrs. Rostenkowski:)If he didn't like it, he wouldn't go.

10
00:00:41,122 --> 00:00:43,352
(Howard:)You know, I hadn't thought of that.

11
00:00:43,558 --> 00:00:45,358
(Howard:)Help me.

12
00:00:47,228 --> 00:00:49,488
(Bernadette:)Dad, maybe you could take Howard
fishing sometime.

13
00:00:49,731 --> 00:00:54,391
- Give you a chance to get to know each other.
- No, no. We know each other well enough.

14
00:00:54,602 --> 00:00:57,592
(Howard:)He's been talking my ear off all night.

